"<strong>Security warning:</strong> a plugin is Python code and runs with "
"full server access; there is no sandbox. Approve only a plugin whose code "
"you have reviewed or that comes from a trusted source. When you approve, "
"only this exact code (the fingerprint below) is allowed to run; any later "
"change to the files stops the plugin immediately."
